[Bo2's Figure 3.3 (Inverting)]

e,2,0,vs
r1,2,1,r1
r2,1,o,r2
o,1,0,o

analysis: dc
note: The inverting amplifier: find the overall gain, vo/vs, on the Evaluate line. It comes back -r2/r1.
image: https://learn.symbulator.com/assets/practice/bo2s-figure-3-3-inverting-4.jpg
rounding: exact
si: no
units: yes
evaluate: vo/vs


